              "name": "Kathleen Wishard"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I found this recipe because I had nutella and peanut butter and I needed something that used both. This did wonderfully. Loved it! I did't have enough nutella so I threw in 1/2 a bag of chocolate chips. Yummy and decadent."
