            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rose"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I wanted to try this as an alternative to my usual no bakes, and they were pretty good. I did make a few alterations with the second batch. I used hazelnut butter instead of peanut butter, and I used less oats because I found them a little too dry without adding milk. A nice change, but I like my traditional recipe better.",
